    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭb-ālāris</span></b> ,
		e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that is under the arms</i>, <i>placed</i> or <i>carried under the arms</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">telum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nep. Alcib. 10, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">culcitae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Heliog. 19 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—As <i>substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭbālāres</span></b> ,
				ĭum, f.
			plur., <i>the feathers under the
			wing</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. 4</span></i> Esd. 11,
			25.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭbālāre</span></b> ,
			is, n., <i>an
			under-girdle</i>, Edict. Diocl. p. 25; cf.
				<i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 19, 33</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
